It does not contain Apprise's code, but its tests depend on Apprise's behaviour
and on material derived from Apprise's sources and tests:

  crates/tocsin/compat/fixtures.json
      Notification URLs taken from Apprise's test suite, or written by hand to
      reach branches of Apprise's URL parsing. Each entry names the Apprise
      file and lines it comes from.

  crates/tocsin/compat/oracle.json
      What Apprise prints for those URLs, produced by
      crates/tocsin/compat/apprise_oracle.py.

  crates/tocsin/compat/apprise_oracle.py
      A script that loads Apprise and instantiates each URL without any
      network access.

